    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38760" root="مغث" body-key="m">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَغِثٌ</span></b> , (S, K,) or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَغْثٌ</span></b> , (L,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُمَاغِثٌ</span></b> , (L,)
<i>A strong wrestler.</i> (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also, the latter, A
man <i>pertinacious in altercation.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَغِثٌ</span>
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَغِيثٌ</span></b>  An <i>evil, a wicked,</i> or <i>malignant,</i> man:
after the manner of a rel. n. [denoting habitual
state or action, and the like]. (TA.)

